May Update - Social Dinner=0D
=0D
=0D
Dear attendees,=0D
=0D
Great news! I have an important update regarding the social dinner for th=
e=0D
CATHY days workshop. We have made a reservation at Ristorante Cianzia=0D
located at Via Cavour <https://www.cortinaup.it/locale/ristorante-cianzia=
/>,=0D
83, 32040 Borca di Cadore BL.=0D
=0D
The dinner will be held on the evening of Wednesday, May 31st, and we wil=
l=0D
arrange transportation to the restaurant by car.=0D
=0D
Now, I kindly request each participant to inform us about any dietary=0D
restrictions or preferences such as vegetarian, allergies, or vegan (see=0D=

menu below). This is crucial to ensure a pleasant dining experience for=0D=

everyone!=0D
